  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "10.6.7 - New (Edit Controls): EditBool.Indeterminate (AntD mixed state); IsOptionDisabled on the four checkbox/radio group controls; button-style radio mode (OptionType=Button with ButtonStyle/Size); EditFile MIME and wildcard accept tokens, async BeforeAdd gate, per-file size display, and Button variant; AntD input features on EditString/EditTextArea/EditNumber (Prefix/Suffix, AllowClear, MaxLength/ShowCount, IsPassword, AutoSize, Min/Max) plus the opt-in .edit-theme chrome and Size. New (UI Kit): CSS-only data-tooltip hover tooltips with JS auto-placement; DatePicker/DateRangePicker phase 2 (Month/Quarter/Year/Week/Time/DateTime modes, DisabledDate/DisabledTime, time-row options, presets and footers), forwarded through EditDatePicker/EditDateRange, and EditDatePicker generalized to DateTime/DateTime?/DateOnly/DateOnly?; AntD 4.x parity batches for Select (Loading, option groups, FilterOption, controlled Open, Borderless), Pagination/Table (ShowTotal, page-size changer, quick jumper, Loading, single-select and per-row selection, controlled expansion, row click, Ellipsis, footer row, column filtering, ScrollY sticky header), Modal/Drawer (Centered, Keyboard, Drawer.Extra), Popconfirm/Popover (async confirm-loading, OkDanger, controlled Visible), Alert (Banner, Action), SearchInput (AllowClear, EnterButtonText), Tabs (TabBarExtraContent, Centered, card Type), Skeleton (Avatar/AvatarShape, SkeletonElement), and notification Placement. Changed: LabelTooltip restyled to the AntD dark look with auto-placement and a CSS-only reveal (was always-above and C#-driven); DatePicker/EditDatePicker ShowToday now defaults to true; Modal/Drawer Escape-to-close is governed by Keyboard, no longer gated by Closable. Fixes across the Select engine (Disabled now always implies closed; FilterOption swaps refresh an open dropdown), Table (Single-mode clamping, stale header checkbox, Loading mask covering the pagers, filter dropdown stacking/tracking/page-reset, narrow header layout), Popconfirm/Popover (reopen after a Disabled-forced close, pending-confirm lock, positioning race, OK focus), Alert (stale Type), EditFile (re-entrant change events, accept-all and whitespace tokens, drop-zone click), and EditRadioEnum (Other input honors IsOptionDisabled). See the README changelog for details.",
